BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Proxima b: in orbit</h1>
A delta-glider in a 500 km orbit about Proxima b, the nearest exoplanet,
4.2 light years from the Sun. Below, an eyeball world (assumed): open sea
about the point beneath the star, a deck of cloud over it, ice beyond. Alpha
Centauri A and B shine as a bright double star.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 61000.0
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship PRX-1
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET Proxima b
  MODE Extern
  POS 2.6 90.0 -15
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 60.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
PRX-1:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Orbiting Proxima b
  ELEMENTS 7.22e6 0.00000 30.0 0.0 0.0 0.0 61000.0
  AROT 0 0 0
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
